    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Money Recovered"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Tobi′as called Raphael and said to him, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Brother Azari′as, take a servant and two camels with you and go to Gab′ael at Rages in Media and get the money for me; and bring him to the wedding feast. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For Rag′uel has sworn that I should not leave; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but my father is counting the days, and if I delay long he will be greatly distressed.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Raphael made the journey and stayed over night with Gab′ael. He gave him the receipt, and Gab′ael"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gk he"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brought out the money bags with their seals intact and gave them to him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In the morning they both got up early and came to the wedding feast. And Gab′ael blessed Tobi′as and his wife."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Cn: Gk And Tobias blessed his wife"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}